WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:14.520
It’s project time! Build a quiz game on a topic you love: at least five checkable questions, a score that starts at 0, feedback after every answer, and a final message with the score.

2
00:00:14.520 --> 00:00:21.240
Make a quiz on any topic you love: maths, animals, space, cricket… At least five questions, a score, and feedback after every answer.

3
00:00:21.240 --> 00:00:29.020
Write clear questions with one right answer.

4
00:00:29.020 --> 00:00:33.790
Short answers (a number or one word) are easiest to check.

5
00:00:33.790 --> 00:00:37.500
Celebrate correct answers with a sound and a message.

6
00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:41.990
For wrong answers, tell the player the right answer so they learn.

7
00:00:41.990 --> 00:00:45.470
At the end, say the final score with join.

8
00:00:45.470 --> 00:00:48.630
Add a special message for a perfect score!

9
00:00:48.630 --> 00:00:52.730
Great work! Let’s remember what we learned.

10
00:00:52.730 --> 00:00:57.150
Now plan it, build it, test it, and share it!
